sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin as Admin Portal
  participant WS as WS /live-map/ws
  participant LMS as LiveMapService
  participant DB as Database
  participant GPS as Redis GPS (gps:last hash + gps:geo)

  Admin->>WS: Connect ?token=clerk_jwt
  WS->>WS: verify_clerk_token
  loop every 5 seconds
    WS->>LMS: snapshot()
    LMS->>DB: active orders + drivers
    LMS->>GPS: gps_board.board_pins (live_map_service.py:191)
    LMS-->>WS: map data
    WS-->>Admin: {"type":"snapshot","data":...}
  end

  Note over Admin,GPS: Only WebSocket in codebase.<br/>No customer/merchant WS.
